SUMMARY:Community Event: DRAW NAKED PEOPLE #9
DESCRIPTION:DRAW NAKED PEOPLE\nAll naked bodies are beautiful and they are a very good subject for drawings!\nYou don’t need any experience to pick up a pencil to draw what you see. During this evening we’ll explore drawing different bodies in different poses. Expect poses of 1\, 2\, 5\, 10 minutes to try and challenge your creative hand.\nYou’ll be working independently (it’s not a ‘class’) but you’ll get helpful suggestions to play with materials\, style and your creativity.\nWe’ll be drawing flat\, not on easels. Different drawing materials and paper will be present to use but feel free to bring your own preferred media\, like iPads\, markers\, charcoal\, gouache etc.\n\nThis event is donation based pay as you can – 100% proceeds for models and use of materials.\n\nWednesday 7th October\nDoors open 19.30\, start 20.00 til 22.00 – free to walk in or out at other times if there is space (usually full)\n&nbsp\;
CATEGORIES:course/workshop
LOCATION:#_LOCATIONNAME\, #_LOCATIONFULLLINE\, #_LOCATIONCOUNTRY
URL:https://occii.org/events/community-event-draw-naked-people-9/
X-RDR-COST:Donation based
END:VEVENT
