SUMMARY:Ragdawl presents: Tray + Honey Blonde + No Offense + Systeemfalen
DESCRIPTION:Ragdawl presents: Tray + Honey Blonde + No Offense + Systeemfalen\nTray\nTray is a 3-piece grunge band from Hilversum. They use music as an outlet\, yearning for connection through sincerity and candour. Their performance sounds like an explosive and overwhelming combination of Alice In Chains\, Sepultura\, and My Bloody Valentine.\nTheir intense\, bombastic presence on stage drags you in as they convey their message with raw emotion and a healthy dose of satire. When they play\, you’re a part of their performance.\n\n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/_tray_band_/\n\nhttps://linktr.ee/trayband?utm_source=linktree_profile_share&amp\;ltsid=aa52a5a4-7983-4647-9d8c-02c1989914a1\nHoney Blonde\nHoney Blonde is a pink-punk band from Utrecht. Inspired by the new wave of the riot grrrl movement\, this feminist foursome creates no-nonsense girl punk with a sweet edge. Honey Blonde draws inspiration from commitment issues\, annoying men\, and hangovers. With a danceable\, high-energy mix of punk and pop\, Honey Blonde wants to show that punk can be not only loud and fierce\, but also vulnerable and joyful. With relatable and catchy songs\, Honey Blonde hopes to connect misfits and cool kids alike!\n\n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/itshoneyblonde/\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UC9dEUgLs1QOKfcPf3bmfUkA\nNo Offense\nNo Offense is a hard rock band born out of young friendship\, raw passion\, and a love\nfor unfiltered loudness. Fueled by a bond that’s just as solid as their riffs\, No Offense\nbrings a versatile sound that pulls together the punch of hard rock with a rebellious\,\ncarefree spirit. Each track pulses with an energy that’s gritty yet accessible\, capturing\neverything from classic rock grooves to edgy\, modern riffs.\n\nSysteemfalen\n&nbsp\;\n\nPresale/door prices adjusted: our events are set up by volunteers in favour of supporting DIY touring acts\, but it is getting ever more risky to plan and book events – please support the community and buy your tickets early! Presale closes 18.00 on day of the show.
CATEGORIES:music
LOCATION:#_LOCATIONNAME\, #_LOCATIONFULLLINE\, #_LOCATIONCOUNTRY
URL:https://occii.org/events/ragdawl-presents-tray-shitman-honey-blonde/
