SUMMARY:Sad and Gazing x Linger present a shoegaze day festival in honour of pagan Christmas traditions
DESCRIPTION:Sad and Gazing x Linger present a shoegaze day festival in honour of pagan Christmas traditions\n\nAs capitalism ravages through the holiday season\, replacing celebration with consumerism and profit\, we come together to remember alternative forms of celebration increasingly forgotten under capitalisms naturalisation.\n\nAlongside guest speeches\, this night features shoegaze\, dream pop\, and post-rock talent from the Netherlands and beyond.\n\nLINE-UP\n\nBrand\, Collectiv\nGarden Walk\nTurmeric\nBedworms\nMother Johnson\n\nDoors @ 18:00\n\n----\n\nOur events are set up by volunteers in favour of supporting DIY touring acts\, but it is getting ever more risky to plan and book events – please support the community and buy your tickets early! Presale closes 16.00 on day of the show.
